  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Livelihoods Programme Zimbabwe - CADEC Hwange (Binga)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.	Improved capacity of 25,000 households to produce or acquire sufficient food by means of improved agricultural practices and where necessary, targeted household rations
2.	Improved and sustained access to safe water and sanitation by 5,000 vulnerable households
3.	Improved access to care and support for 6,000 HIV affected households
4.	Strengthened capacity of partners to ensure all programme components and activities are informed by and responding to HIV and gender.
5.	Policy and practice influenced at all levels as it relates to the needs of vulnerable households
6.	Sustained and focused capacity building provided, enabling partners to implement the programme effectively using a partnership approach.</narrative>
  </description>
